      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4 flex-wrap">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span
            class="mt-0.5 flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-base"
            >⚡</span
          >
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">
              Unsicher, ob dein CRM richtig aufgestellt ist?
            </p>
